        "name": "compute_columns_for_custody_group Helper",
        "description": "Computes the set of column indices that belong to a given custody group. Uses interleaved mapping: columns_per_group = NUMBER_OF_COLUMNS / NUMBER_OF_CUSTODY_GROUPS, with column = NUMBER_OF_CUSTODY_GROUPS * i + custody_group.",
